## 7. Summary Scorecard

| Category | Score | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| **Code Quality** | 6/10 | Good memoization patterns; duplicate sidebar code and suppressed linter hurt |
| **Security** | 5/10 | CSP weaknesses, unimplemented "Forgot Password", open redirect risk |
| **Accessibility** | 5/10 | Some ARIA usage; missing label associations, unlabeled buttons |
| **Performance** | 8/10 | Strong — lazy loading, font optimization, image compression, React Query caching |
| **UX** | 7/10 | Clean design; silent error states and broken fallback images need fixing |
| **Architecture** | 7/10 | Good separation; sidebar duplication and localStorage polling are technical debt |
| **Overall** | **6.3/10** | Solid foundation, needs targeted fixes before production |

